<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#1a3c6e">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<link rel="manifest" id="pwaManifest">
<title>Kantin Satış</title>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  body { background: #f0f2f5; padding: 15px; padding-top: calc(15px + env(safe-area-inset-top)); padding-bottom: calc(15px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  body.dark { background: #12161d; color: #dfe5ee; }
  .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { text-align: center; color: #1a3c6e; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px; }
  body.dark h1 { color: #8fb4ea; }
  .tab-bar { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab { flex: 1; padding: 12px 2px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; background: #d9dee5; color: #333; margin: 0; }
  .tab.active { background: #1a3c6e; color: #fff; }
  body.dark .tab { background: #2a3342; color: #cdd6e4; }
  body.dark .tab.active { background: #3b6bb3; color: #fff; }
  .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); margin-bottom: 15px; }
  body.dark .card { background: #1c2330; box-shadow: none; }
  .card h2 { font-size: 16px; color: #1a3c6e; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  body.dark .card h2 { color: #8fb4ea; }
  .hint { font-size: 13px; color: #777; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  body.dark .hint { color: #93a1b5; }
  label { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
  body.dark label { color: #9fb0c8; }
  input { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; }
  body.dark input, body.dark select, body.dark textarea { background: #232c3b; border-color: #3a465a; color: #e8edf5; }
  input:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #7aa7e6; outline-offset: 1px; }
  button { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #1a3c6e; color: #fff; }
  .btn-success { background: #2e7d32; color: #fff; }
  .btn-danger { background: #c62828; color: #fff; }
  .btn-gray { background: #607d8b; color: #fff; }
  .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .row input { flex: 1; }
  .row button { width: auto; margin-top: 0; padding: 10px 18px; }
  .msg { padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; display: none; }
  .msg.ok { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; display: block; }
  .msg.err { background: #fdecea; color: #c62828; display: block; }
  .msg.info { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; display: block; }
  body.dark .msg.ok { background: #1d3325; color: #7ddb8a; }
  body.dark .msg.err { background: #3a1d1d; color: #f08a80; }
  body.dark .msg.info { background: #1b2c44; color: #7fb2ec; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  th, td { padding: 8px 4px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: middle; }
  th { background: #f5f5f5; }
  body.dark th { background: #232c3b; }
  body.dark td, body.dark th { border-color: #2c3646; }
  td.num, th.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  .total { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a3c6e; text-align: right; margin-top: 12px; }
  body.dark .total { color: #8fb4ea; }
  .small { width: auto; margin: 0; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .qty { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .qty button { width: 30px; height: 30px; padding: 0; margin: 0; background: #d9dee5; color: #1a3c6e; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
  .qty button.wide { width: 40px; font-size: 13px; }
  .qty span { min-width: 18px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; max-height: 340px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .prod { background: #eef3fb; color: #1a3c6e; border: 1px solid #c9d7ee; margin: 0; padding: 12px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: normal; }
  body.dark .prod { background: #253247; border-color: #3a4a66; color: #cfe0f7; }
  .prod b { display: block; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 4px; word-break: break-word; }
  .prod:active { background: #d6e3f7; }
  .empty { color: #777; font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 0; }
  body.dark .empty { color: #8a97ab; }
  .prod .stock { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #5b6b82; margin-top: 3px; }
  .prod.out { background: #f4f4f4; border-color: #ddd; color: #888; }
  body.dark .prod.out { background: #20242c; color: #7c8698; }
  .prod.out .stock { color: #c62828; }
  .warn { color: #c62828; font-size: 12px; display: block; }
  select { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; background: #fff; }
  .row select { width: auto; }
  textarea { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
  .cin { width: 78px; text-align: center; padding: 8px; }
  .diff { font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; }
  .diff.ok { color: #2e7d32; } .diff.bad { color: #c62828; }
  td.lbl { color: #555; }
  body.dark td.lbl { color: #9fb0c8; }
  tr.strong td { font-weight: bold; color: #1a3c6e; }
  body.dark tr.strong td { color: #8fb4ea; }
  .hidden { display: none !important; }
  .tab-bar .tab { flex: 1 1 21%; }
  .btn-wa { display: block; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; background: #1f9d55; color: #fff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .msgprev { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f6f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; margin: 8px 0; word-break: break-word; }
  body.dark .msgprev { background: #232c3b; }
  textarea.mt { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; }
  .product-list { max-height: 420px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .code { color: #888; font-size: 12px; word-break: break-all; }
  body.dark .code { color: #8a97ab; }
  .actions { white-space: nowrap; text-align: right; }
  .actions button + button { margin-left: 4px; }
  .chips { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 10px; }
  .chip { border: 1px solid #c9d7ee; background: #eef3fb; color: #1a3c6e; border-radius: 14px; padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; width: auto; font-weight: bold; }
  .chip.active { background: #1a3c6e; color: #fff; }
  body.dark .chip { background: #253247; border-color: #3a4a66; color: #cfe0f7; }
  body.dark .chip.active { background: #3b6bb3; color: #fff; }
  #recentStrip { display: flex; gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 6px; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  #recentStrip .chip { white-space: nowrap; }
  .change-box { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; margin-top: 8px; }
  .change-box.ok { color: #2e7d32; }
  .change-box.bad { color: #c62828; }
  .banner { background: #fff3e0; border: 1px solid #ffe0a3; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #7a5b16; }
  .banner .row { margin-top: 8px; }
  body.dark .banner { background: #33261a; color: #e8c88a; border-color: #5a431f; }
  .modal-wrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 50; padding: 15px; }
  .modal { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 480px; width: 100%; max-height: 85vh; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; color: #222; }
  .modal h3 { color: #1a3c6e; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .modal h4 { color: #1a3c6e; }
  body.dark .modal { background: #1c2330; color: #dfe5ee; }
  body.dark .modal h3, body.dark .modal h4 { color: #8fb4ea; }
  #printArea { display: none; }
  @media print {
    body.printing > *:not(#printArea) { display: none !important; }
    body.printing { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
    #printArea { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #000; }
    #printArea h2 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    #printArea h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
    #printArea table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }
    #printArea td, #printArea th { border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 4px; text-align: left; }
    #printArea td.num, #printArea th.num { text-align: right; }
  }
  #chartBox { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px; height: 110px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .barw { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; height: 100%; }
  .bar { width: 100%; background: #1a3c6e; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; margin-top: auto; min-height: 2px; }
  body.dark .bar { background: #3b6bb3; }
  .barw span { font-size: 10px; color: #888; }
  body.dark .barw span { color: #8a97ab; }
  a.btn-success { text-decoration: none; display: block; text-align: center; }

  /* ===== Giriş ekranı ===== */
  #authWrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1a3c6e,#2d5b9e); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 200; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto; }
  #authWrap.hidden { display: none; }
  #authCard { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 22px; max-width: 400px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  body.dark #authCard { background: #1c2330; color: #dfe5ee; }
  #authCard h2 { color: #1a3c6e; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 22px; }
  body.dark #authCard h2 { color: #8fb4ea; }
  #authCard p.sub { text-align: center; color: #777; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  body.dark #authCard p.sub { color: #93a1b5; }
  #authCard input { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  #authCard .link { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #1a3c6e; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 14px; display: block; }
  #authCard .link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  body.dark #authCard .link { color: #8fb4ea; }
  .sync-status { font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; }
  .sync-ok { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
  .sync-wait { background: #fff3e0; color: #b26a00; }
  .sync-err { background: #fdecea; color: #c62828; }
  .sync-off { background: #eceff1; color: #607d8b; }
  body.dark .sync-ok { background: #1d3325; color: #7ddb8a; }
  body.dark .sync-wait { background: #33261a; color: #e8c88a; }
  body.dark .sync-err { background: #3a1d1d; color: #f08a80; }
  body.dark .sync-off { background: #232c3b; color: #9fb0c8; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Giriş / Kayıt Ekranı -->
<div id="authWrap">
  <div id="authCard">
    <h2>🏪 Kantin Satış</h2>
    <p class="sub" id="authSub">Hesabınıza giriş yapın</p>

    <div id="authLoginView">
      <input type="email" id="authEmail" placeholder="E-posta" autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="off">
      <input type="password" id="authPass" placeholder="Şifre" autocomplete="current-password">
      <div id="authMsg" class="msg"></div>
      <button class="btn-primary" id="authBtn" onclick="doLogin()">Giriş Yap</button>
      <a class="link" onclick="showAuthMode('register')">Hesabınız yok mu? Kayıt olun</a>
      <a class="link" onclick="doForgot()">Şifremi unuttum</a>
    </div>

    <div id="authRegView" class="hidden">
      <input type="email" id="regEmail" placeholder="E-posta" autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="off">
      <input type="password" id="regPass" placeholder="Şifre (en az 6 karakter)" autocomplete="new-password">
      <input type="password" id="regPass2" placeholder="Şifre tekrar" autocomplete="new-password">
      <div id="regMsg" class="msg"></div>
      <button class="btn-success" id="regBtn" onclick="doRegister()">Kayıt Ol</button>
      <a class="link" onclick="showAuthMode('login')">Zaten hesabınız var mı? Giriş yapın</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container hidden" id="mainContainer">
  <div class="row" style="align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px">
    <h1 style="flex:1;margin:0;text-align:left">🏪 Kantin Satış</h1>
    <button id="darkBtn" class="btn-gray small" style="width:auto;margin:0;padding:8px 12px" onclick="toggleDark()">🌙</button>
  </div>

  <div id="cloudOffBanner" class="banner hidden" style="background:#e3f2fd;border-color:#90caf9;color:#0d47a1">
    ℹ️ Bulut kapalı: veriler yalnızca bu cihazda saklanıyor. Diğer telefonlardan da erişmek için dosyanın başındaki <b>FIREBASE_CONFIG</b> ayarını yapın.
  </div>

  <div id="lowBanner" class="banner hidden">
    ⚠️ <span id="lowBannerText"></span>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1" onclick="shareLow()">📱 Siparişi Paylaş</button>
      <button class="btn-gray small" style="flex:1" onclick="dismissLow()">Kapat</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="sktBanner" class="banner hidden">
    ⏳ <span id="sktBannerText"></span>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1" onclick="showTab('tools')">Tarihlere Git</button>
      <button class="btn-gray small" style="flex:1" onclick="dismissSkt()">Kapat</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-bar">
    <button class="tab active" id="tabSell" onclick="showTab('sell')">Satış</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabDefine" onclick="showTab('define')">Ekle</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabList" onclick="showTab('list')">Ürünler</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabCount" onclick="showTab('count')">Sayım</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabSummary" onclick="showTab('summary')">Özet</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabTools" onclick="showTab('tools')">Araçlar</button>
    <button class="tab" id="tabMsg" onclick="showTab('msg')">Mesaj</button>
  </div>

  <!-- SATIŞ -->
  <div id="panel-sell">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🛒 Ürün Ekle</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <button id="modeP1" class="tab active" style="flex:1" onclick="setPriceMode('p1')">Öğrenci</button>
        <button id="modeP2" class="tab" style="flex:1" onclick="setPriceMode('p2')">Öğretmen</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:6px">Ürüne dokunun ya da kodunu yazıp Enter'a basın. USB / Bluetooth barkod okuyucu da çalışır. İki fiyatı tanımlı ürünlerde yukarıdaki seçim geçerlidir.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <input type="text" id="codeInput" placeholder="Ürün kodu" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" enterkeyhint="done">
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="addByCode()">Ekle</button>
      </div>
      <div id="sellMsg" class="msg"></div>
      <input type="search" id="searchInput" placeholder="Ürün ara" style="margin-top:12px" oninput="renderGrid()" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="chips" id="catChips"></div>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0">🔁 Son satılanlar (dokununca sepete eklenir):</p>
      <div id="recentStrip"></div>
      <div class="grid" id="productGrid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>🧾 Sepet</h2>
      <table id="cartTable">
        <thead><tr><th>Ürün</th><th class="num">Adet</th><th class="num">Tutar</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="cartBody"></tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="total" id="cartTotal">Toplam: 0,00 ₺</div>
      <label for="paidAmt">Alınan para (para üstü için, isteğe bağlı)</label>
      <div class="row">
        <input type="text" id="paidAmt" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Örn: 100" oninput="updateChange()" autocomplete="off">
        <button class="btn-gray" onclick="document.getElementById('paidAmt').value='';updateChange()">Sil</button>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:6px">
        <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1;margin-top:0;padding:10px 4px" onclick="setPaid(50)">50 ₺</button>
        <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1;margin-top:0;padding:10px 4px" onclick="setPaid(100)">100 ₺</button>
        <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1;margin-top:0;padding:10px 4px" onclick="setPaid(200)">200 ₺</button>
        <button class="btn-primary small" style="flex:1;margin-top:0;padding:10px 4px" onclick="setPaid('exact')">Tutar</button>
      </div>
      <div id="changeBox" class="change-box"></div>
      <button class="btn-success" onclick="completeSale()">Satışı Tamamla</button>
      <input type="text" id="debtName" list="debtNames" placeholder="Veresiye için kişi adı" style="margin-top:10px" autocomplete="off">
      <datalist id="debtNames"></datalist>
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="completeSale(true)">Veresiyeye Yaz</button>
      <button class="btn-gray" onclick="undoSale()">Son Satışı Geri Al</button>
      <button class="btn-danger" onclick="clearCart()">Sepeti Temizle</button>
      <div id="cartMsg" class="msg"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ÜRÜN EKLE -->
  <div id="panel-define" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 id="defineTitle">➕ Yeni Ürün</h2>
      <label for="newName">Ürün adı</label>
      <input type="text" id="newName" placeholder="Örn: Tost" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="newPrice">Fiyat (₺)</label>
      <input type="text" id="newPrice" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Örn: 25 veya 12,50" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="newPrice2">2. fiyat / öğretmen fiyatı (isteğe bağlı)</label>
      <input type="text" id="newPrice2" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Örn: 30" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="newCat">Kategori (isteğe bağlı)</label>
      <input type="text" id="newCat" list="catList" placeholder="Örn: İçecek" autocomplete="off">
      <datalist id="catList"><option>İçecek</option><option>Atıştırmalık</option><option>Gofret &amp; Kek</option><option>Şekerleme</option><option>Süt Ürünü</option><option>Diğer</option></datalist>
      <label for="newStock">Raf stoğu (isteğe bağlı)</label>
      <input type="text" id="newStock" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Örn: 24" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="newCode">Barkod / ürün kodu (isteğe bağlı)</label>
      <input type="text" id="newCode" placeholder="Boş bırakırsanız otomatik verilir" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off">
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:6px">Barkod okuyucunuz varsa bu alana tıklayıp ürünü okutun. Mal girişleri "Sayım" sekmesinden depoya eklenir.</p>
      <button class="btn-success" id="saveBtn" onclick="saveProduct()">Ürünü Kaydet</button>
      <button class="btn-gray hidden" id="cancelEditBtn" onclick="cancelEdit()">Vazgeç</button>
      <div id="defineMsg" class="msg"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SAYIM -->
  <div id="panel-count" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📅 Ay Özeti</h2>
      <p class="hint" id="periodInfo"></p>
      <table><tbody id="monthBody"></tbody></table>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📦 Mal Girişi (Depoya)</h2>
      <p class="hint">Aldığınız malı depoya kaydedin; alışveriş tutarı aya eklenir. Depodan rafı "Araçlar &gt; Depodan Rafa Taşı" ile doldurun.</p>
      <label for="inProduct">Ürün</label>
      <select id="inProduct" onchange="fillCost()"></select>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
        <input type="text" id="inQty" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Adet" autocomplete="off">
        <input type="text" id="inCost" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Alış fiyatı ₺" autocomplete="off">
      </div>
      <button class="btn-success" onclick="saveIn()">Mal Girişini Kaydet</button>
      <div id="inMsg" class="msg"></div>
      <details style="margin-top:14px">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#1a3c6e;font-weight:bold">📋 Excel'den toplu mal girişi</summary>
        <p class="hint" style="margin-top:8px">Excel'de başlık satırıyla birlikte (Barkod, Ürün, Satınalma Fiyatı, Satış Fiyatı, Miktar, Fatura) ilgili satırları kopyalayıp yapıştırın ya da CSV dosyası seçin.</p>
        <textarea id="xlText" rows="5" placeholder="Buraya yapıştırın" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px"></textarea>
        <input type="file" id="xlFile" accept=".csv,.tsv,.txt" style="margin-top:8px">
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="previewExcelIn()">Önizle</button>
        <div id="xlMsg" class="msg"></div>
        <div id="xlPreview"></div>
        <button class="btn-success hidden" id="xlApply" onclick="applyExcelIn()">Onayla ve Ekle</button>
      </details>
      <div id="inList"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🔢 Ay Sonu Sayım</h2>
